        "fun": "Machop's muscles never tire or cramp, and it can lift many times its own weight, enough to hurl 100 adults. It spends its days training in every kind of martial art, using boulders and even Graveler as barbells, and the more its muscles grow, the harder it trains. Once it feels ready, it goes looking for a Makuhita to fight.",
