      "description": {
        "fun": "Machoke can lift heavy objects with one finger and has muscles as hard as steel, yet it's modest and often helps people with heavy manual labour. The championship-style belt it wears keeps its power in check; it only takes it off for a truly strong opponent. Its build makes it a popular model for sculptures.",
