      "description": {
        "fun": "With four arms, Machamp can throw 500 punches a second, pin all of a foe's limbs at once, and attack and block at the same time; one hand is said to be enough to move a mountain. It knows every martial art in the world. Its arms react faster than it can think, though, so delicate work just gets them tangled.",
        "guide": "The final stage of Machop's line, a four-armed Fighting Pokémon said to have mastered every martial art. It can throw hundreds of punches a second but is clumsy with delicate tasks. It evolves from Machoke when traded and has a Gigantamax form.",
